{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ミルクチップにはまってる和田です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイスとミルクチップは関係なかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぬぉぉぉぉぉお！！！？？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついにゴボウとモヤシではなく\n浮気するのか............"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいっ！\nそんなことわありましぇん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は浮気なんぞしましぇん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウサギのトトロ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さい頃だよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、せいたんと語っていたら......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『これをのりこえたらきっとまぁやはすごい人になるよ！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって！\nなんか凄く偉い人みたいだね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ウレシーかぎりです...www\nせいたん大好きだよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"回りのメンバーは\n『誰だよーww 』\n『なにを根拠に言ってんのーww』\nって言ってた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まったくもー！\n面白いんだからー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪の毛がホウキみたい！わら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんで、ほんで、今日はちょっくらレッスン前に川後のひなさまとカラオケにいってまいりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このホウキみたいな髪は、魔法かかったのかぁ〜ウキャ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！\n私、blog書くの、いっきに書かずに、\n暇なときにちょっとずつ書いていってるから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カラオケ行ったとか、\nせいたんと語ったとか、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色々急に話がかわってるぶぶんがございますが、\n華麗にスルーしてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校が終わりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、夏休みに向けてのお話を聞いたり、宿題がめっちゃくちゃ大量に！\nこれでもかっ！ってくらい大量に配られたり......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう夏休み気分です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、\n今、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンブルじぃじ(かずみん)\nまいやん\nまあや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の三人で行動中に、\n高山\n『今日一年に一度のヨンコママンガを買いに行くのー(*^^*)』\n和田\n『一年に一度？』\n高山\n『うん！前は、二年に一度とか、３年に一度だったんだよー』\n白石\n『なんか発売日忘れちゃいそうだねー！？』\n和田\n『なんか四年に一度のオリンピックみたいだね♪』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っと言う会話をした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！そういえば！\nダンブルじぃじ(かずみん)に本借りて返してなかった！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かえさなきゃぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でわ！\n明日、大阪に遊びに来てねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まってまーす"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！キャッチフレーズは、皆様からのが沢山いいのがあってちょっと少し時間くださーい。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すみませぇん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様からの掛け声があったら元気一杯まあやマンだよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪といえばー？わら"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/14/9412738/0004.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}